{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14226954","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14226954","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1422695401:0":{"text":"虚言はそこまでだ、デリア。どこでその霊水を手に入れた？","source_cn":"谎言止步于此，德莱雅。灵露从何而来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x545B0A5D74B60501","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1422695402:0":{"text":"ふっ、誰が言うものですか！","source_cn":"哼！我不会告诉你的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF5A27100680B7910","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1422695403:0":{"text":"黙っていればやり過ごせると思うなよ。","source_cn":"你以为嘴硬可以扛过去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7EA6EAF695ADA6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1422695404:0":{"text":"たとえ殺されようとも、私の信仰は揺るぎません！","source_cn":"我的信仰坚定，宁死也不会背叛。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF82A8740F95708D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1422695405:0":{"text":"殺す？勘違いするな。死なせずに口を開かせる方法など、サリエ様ならいくらでも思いつく。","source_cn":"死？谁说要你死了？沙利叶有一千种方法让你开口，却不会给...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25160FAABFF4BDFD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say